 900 gram of flour dinner roll  recipe if i've replaced 250 grams with  casein  i was i was pretty enthused with what  the macros looked like so i said yeah  [ __ ] it i'm gonna try it and so last  weekend i made a batch of protein bread  and again i'm not gonna say that it was  as good as the real thing but it was  like  90 as good as the real thing and  honestly  my complaints with it don't relate to  the casing um i did not  trust my baking skills enough and so  since i was i was thinking like since  i'm reducing the gluten content i want  to put another binder in there just to  make sure  that everything holds together the way i  want it to and so i added three whole  eggs and so really my only complaint  about the bread is it has  a slightly stronger eggy flavor than i  prefer  uh and it's it's not particularly bad  it's not offensive and since these are  dinner rolls like if you microwave it  and slap a little butter on it it  completely uh covers the eggy flavor so  i would say that i'm  90  of the way to  having a protein bread recipe that i'm  very very satisfied with so uh  this episode's gonna come out on  thursday  probably on friday  if you're listening to this pretty soon  after it comes out i am going to go  attempt number two for protein bread and  this time i'm leaning into something  kind of brioche so i'm gonna replace the  three eggs  with egg yolks uh probably six yolks  and  um  probably increase  the amount of honey that i put in the  bread make it a little bit sweeter so if  if there is still any  uh eggy taste or if some of the casein  flavor starts coming through a little  more a little bit of honey will cover  for that and maybe a touch of butter as  well  i'll play around with the recipe just  in theory to see what would still give  me macros i liked um  but i'm gonna be making that uh between  friday and saturday because i'm gonna go  with an overnight proof  so uh keep an eye on my instagram  stories if i  if i perfect protein bread i t